[I] A physical memory manipulation and hacking tool

[T] Inception is a physical memory manipulation and hacking tool exploiting
[T] PCI-based DMA. The tool can attack over FireWire, Thunderbolt, ExpressCard,
[T] PC Card and any other PCI/PCIe interfaces.

[U] https://github.com/carmaa/inception

